The script currently loads critical input artifacts directly using `readJson` without error handling. If any of these files are missing or malformed, it will throw an unhandled exception and crash. To ensure robust execution, handle missing or malformed critical artifacts gracefully by safely parsing them, recording diagnostics, and failing closed with a failed validation status.

